Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.46,0:01:00.10,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:01:01.75,Default,,0,0,900,,Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.75,0:01:07.45,Default,,0,0,900,,Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.15,0:01:13.15,Default,,0,0,900,,He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:19.55,Default,,0,0,900,,does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.15,0:01:25.36,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.90,0:01:31.10,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.70,0:01:36.90,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.10,0:01:42.30,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:54.66,Default,,0,0,900,,I am calling, calling now.\NSpirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.30,0:02:00.10,Default,,0,0,900,,To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:06.43,Default,,0,0,900,,Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.45,0:02:11.93,Default,,0,0,900,,in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.40,0:02:17.90,Default,,0,0,900,,To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.90,0:02:23.30,Default,,0,0,900,,The flow may shallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:52.05,Style,,200,0,700,,Murai Vaccine Recipients List
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.59,0:03:10.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.62,0:03:32.43,Default,,400,0,600,,{\b1\i1}The \NDeleted\N Medicine{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.15,0:03:43.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.15,0:03:45.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Next?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.15,0:03:47.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sectors B-14 through 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.81,0:04:03.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The extracted memory\Ncorresponds with her testimony.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.81,0:04:07.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This means that she is not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.01,0:04:11.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, she was only doing the paperwork and\Nwas unaware of the document's import.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.21,0:04:15.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, it has been confirmed that the\Nmemory-overwrite of the witnesses concerning Nanao A
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.41,0:04:20.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,was executed by an official order from the Ministry\Nof Health, Labour and Welfare that she issued.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.71,0:04:26.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If so, wouldn't it be reasonable to assume that\Nher superiors at the Ministry are involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.51,0:04:30.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Moreover, the Ministry was also\Nbeing hacked by the vocational centre
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.51,0:04:33.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,where I conducted my failed\Nundercover investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.51,0:04:39.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm telling you, there is {\i1}something{\i} in the Ministry\Nregarding the Laughing Man case that they want to keep hidden!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.51,0:04:44.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Or, it could be that there is a third party who wishes us\Nto assume as much, and is mediating this whole affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:48.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If so, it's all the more reason to attempt\Nanother dive into the Ministry's database.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.21,0:04:53.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ishikawa and Bomer have already conducted enough\Nsalvage operations to make themselves sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.41,0:04:57.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There was no record of\Ntampering anywhere, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.11,0:05:01.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In information theft, what is stolen is not lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.01,0:05:04.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so we just have to try another method.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.21,0:05:08.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Ministry of Health,\NLabour and Welfare does indeed appear suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.71,0:05:14.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, if we were to conduct an official\Ninvestigation, our intentions would be laid bare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.01,0:05:17.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If we proceed with a formal\Ninvestigation in spite of this drawback,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:20.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,we'll need to secure a suitable payoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:39.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry, I know it's dinner time...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.60,0:05:41.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Try the potatoes. They're really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.81,0:05:46.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.61,0:05:49.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think they turned out well today, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.11,0:05:50.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yep, they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.62,0:05:59.99,Style,,450,0,750,,Catcher in the Rye \N JD Salinger
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:03.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"If I am somewhere where no one knows me,"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.26,0:06:07.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"and I also know no one,"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.56,0:06:10.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"what I thought I'd do there was,"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.66,0:06:16.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"I'd become one of those deaf-mutes."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.81,0:06:19.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"Become..."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.11,0:06:21.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"Should become..."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.11,0:06:23.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"Should I become?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.11,0:06:32.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Could it be...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.32,0:06:41.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I heard that you're pursuing the Salinger link?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.62,0:06:42.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.95,0:06:45.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It is true
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:48.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that he left behind a short story titled "The Laughing\NMan", and that there are quite a few people out there
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.65,0:06:53.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,who have pointed out the similarities\Nbetween that work and the Laughing Man case.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.75,0:06:59.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, the task force has already completed their\Nanalysis of that work's relationship to the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.85,0:07:04.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't think an interpretation of that\Nwork will provide the key to this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.35,0:07:06.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Art imitates life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.25,0:07:09.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If so, the opposite may be true as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.15,0:07:16.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I cannot help but think that the youth I met at\Nthe vocational centre was the real Laughing Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.95,0:07:20.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There have been many who have been\Nsuspected of being the Laughing Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.95,0:07:25.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Given that, what is your basis for\Nbelieving that that youth was the real one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.55,0:07:30.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, you know what the words written\Non the Laughing Man's symbol mean, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.55,0:07:32.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"What I thought I'd do there was,"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.55,0:07:35.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"I'd become one of those deaf-mutes."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.85,0:07:40.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's supposedly drawn from the 25th\Nchapter of "The Catcher in the Rye".
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.55,0:07:43.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, I mentioned it in my report,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.35,0:07:45.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but I found a part of it in\Nthe vocational centre as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.15,0:07:49.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,At first, I was convinced that it was\Ntaken word-for-word from the novel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.45,0:07:56.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but the passage I found continued after\N"I'd become one of those deaf-mutes".
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.03,0:08:01.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"Or should I?" As in, should he become one or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.33,0:08:03.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That was added to the original text.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.73,0:08:07.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wasn't he questioning himself...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.33,0:08:12.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,whether he should break his\Nsilence and rejoin the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.13,0:08:16.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't you feel this way sometimes too, Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.13,0:08:19.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When you try to imitate a\Ncultural figure that you like,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.43,0:08:23.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,you try to mimic him or her\Nas much as possible, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.43,0:08:29.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But the youth who changed Salinger's passage
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.43,0:08:33.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,was able to do so without qualms\Nbecause he {\i1}was{\i} the original.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.23,0:08:37.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That reasoning is quite dependent\Non your personal opinion, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.73,0:08:41.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You do realise that it doesn't hold water\Nas the basis for a theory, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:50.66,Style,,1320,0,850,,This Morning's \N Weather
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:46.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even though the Laughing Man is\Nclassified as a class A+ hacker,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.53,0:08:50.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,he physically abducted President\NSERANO and held a gun to his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.03,0:08:56.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He is a criminal whose anachronistic\Nmethods do not match his abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.93,0:09:01.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It could be that even though\Nhe is an expert hacker...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.23,0:09:08.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,no, because of it, the Laughing Man did\Nnot value rewritable electronic data.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.33,0:09:13.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If so, it may be that what he sought\Nwas data preserved in physical form,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.03,0:09:16.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,or, in other words,\Ninformation preserved in a paper medium.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:19.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And you would like to confirm\Nthat with your own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.03,0:09:20.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.63,0:09:26.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was thinking of stopping you if revenge over\Nwhat happened at the centre was your motive,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.72,0:09:31.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but it could be that your "ghost"\Nis beginning to whisper to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.12,0:09:33.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Permission granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.27,0:09:37.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.97,0:09:39.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll tell the Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.47,0:09:41.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.58,0:09:48.36,Default,,0,0,750,,{\b0}Ministry of Health, Labour and Welfare{\b0\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.94,0:10:01.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.03,0:10:05.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I managed to finish,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.03,0:10:08.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,although the answer has yet to emerge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.63,0:10:12.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I thought you'd give up after\Nthe first two or three days,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.73,0:10:14.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but you're pretty persistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.43,0:10:16.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, it's my job, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.63,0:10:19.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, sorry about the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.23,0:10:23.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, it had to be done.\NIt's my job, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.21,0:10:31.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.01,0:10:34.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.51,0:10:37.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Or rather, what should be here, isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.41,0:10:40.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The list of those who were\Nvaccinated by the Murai vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.51,0:10:42.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's the only one that is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.81,0:10:47.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're right. I wonder if it\Nwas misplaced in another box.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.31,0:10:49.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is this Murai vaccine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.31,0:10:52.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It is a specialised medication that is\Neffective in treating cyberbrain sclerosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.91,0:10:59.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When it was announced, micromachine treatment\Nhad yet to become commercially viable,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.31,0:11:00.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so it created quite a stir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.31,0:11:05.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But in the end,\Nit was never approved for medical use.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.71,0:11:06.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.11,0:11:11.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems that the vaccine\Ndid have a certain effect,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.21,0:11:13.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but no one understood how it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.81,0:11:15.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It somehow worked...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.01,0:11:20.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But if a concrete cause cannot\Nbe linked to a drug's effects,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.11,0:11:22.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,it cannot be approved for medical use.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.71,0:11:24.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.21,0:11:28.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That is why the drug evaluation\Ncommittee could not easily approve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.01,0:11:33.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Besides, Dr. Murai was not an\Nexpert on cyberbrain sclerosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.61,0:11:35.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I guess it was a coincidental discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.42,0:11:39.66,Default,,0,0,900,,A Magic Cure \N The Murai Vaccine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.11,0:11:40.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even so, It was not as though\Neverything went smoothly from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.78,0:11:44.33,Default,,0,0,900,,A specific cure for Cyberbrain Sclerosis
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.11,0:11:43.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I heard that he completed the vaccine\Nafter a grueling period of trial and error.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:49.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And the list of subjects who have\Nbeen vaccinated is missing...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.56,0:11:52.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder how long it's been missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.66,0:11:56.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't think stealing it\Nwould benefit anyone, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:12:02.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Can you think of anyone who might\Nfind value in a file like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.46,0:12:04.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.16,0:12:08.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If I had to come up with a name,\Nit'd be the Sunflower Society.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.86,0:12:10.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"Sunflower"...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.86,0:12:13.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I need to write up my report; it's due tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.23,0:12:23.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,2019.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.23,0:12:27.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,At a time when cyberbrain\Nimplantation was just becoming common,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.03,0:12:32.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,a certain cyberbrain disorder of mysterious\Norigins caused a stir in the medical field.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.53,0:12:35.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sections of the brain that received\Ncyberbrain implants gradually hardened
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.03,0:12:38.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and eventually lead to brain death.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.73,0:12:42.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The disorder was later named cyberbrain sclerosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.23,0:12:46.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,While the probability of getting\Nthis disorder was not high,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.13,0:12:49.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,anyone with cyberbrain implants was susceptible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.73,0:12:54.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Since no cure had been found,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.23,0:13:00.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,following tuberculosis, cancer, and HIV,\Nit was called the incurable disease of the 21st century.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.32,0:13:02.73,Style,,0,500,580,,{\b1\i1}Please enter keywords.{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.10,0:13:02.73,Style,,0,0,450,,{\b1\i1}Murai Vaccine{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.50,0:13:10.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Murai vaccine, developed as a specific cure by\NDr. Murai Chitose, is a tumor-suppressing agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:16.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, medical experts at the time consisted\Nlargely of micromachine treatment advocates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.60,0:13:21.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The vaccine treatment developed by Dr. Murai\Nwas conceptually behind the times,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.30,0:13:22.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and the majority felt that allowing his research
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.80,0:13:27.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,would delay completion of the concurrent\Nresearch on micromachine treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.60,0:13:32.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Perhaps because of such concerns,\Napproval of the Murai vaccine was delayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.40,0:13:37.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Dr. Murai, who hoped for the approval of\Nhis vaccine treatment until the very end,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.80,0:13:40.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,died an unfulfilled death\Nin February 2021 at age 68,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.00,0:13:43.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,without witnessing the decision\Nof the drug evaluation committee.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.40,0:13:48.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, in April 2021,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.80,0:13:56.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the Murai vaccine was suddenly approved for special use\Nby select individuals, after initially being rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.98,0:14:00.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This approval was not made public,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.78,0:14:05.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and patients who used the\Nvaccine do not officially exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.65,0:14:11.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even now, there are those who\Nare interested in the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:21.76,Default,,0,0,700,,The Sunflower Society.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.09,0:14:21.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It is an NPO that supports individuals who file\Nsuit against the government and large corporations.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.09,0:14:27.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They demanded disclosure of\Ninformation on the Murai vaccine
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.92,0:14:26.16,Style,,0,0,900,,{\b1}How to support victims of drug-induced harm{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.25,0:14:27.13,Style,,0,0,900,,{\b1}Symposium on Cyber Sclerosis{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.12,0:14:30.12,Style,,0,0,900,,{\b1}Opening Remarks from our Representatives{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.49,0:14:31.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and those who have received the vaccine from\Ngovernment agencies on multiple occasions in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.09,0:14:33.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, the Ministry of Health,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.99,0:14:36.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Labour and Welfare used the individual privacy\Nact as a shield to reject their demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.79,0:14:44.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Perhaps my belief that there was a connection between the\NSunflower Society and the Laughing Man was... premature.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.15,0:14:52.12,Style,,0,0,900,,{\b1}SUNFLOWER SOCIETY{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.82,0:14:54.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This mark...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.26,0:15:11.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see... You have indeed done your research.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:14.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you a freelance journalist?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.66,0:15:20.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Actually, my father passed away a few\Nmonths ago from cyberbrain sclerosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.26,0:15:23.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He received micromachine\Ntreatment until the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.86,0:15:28.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I found out abut your Society's activities later,\Nalong with the existence of the Murai vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.56,0:15:30.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.26,0:15:31.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I am sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.56,0:15:36.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If only someone had told me about the\Nvaccine's efficacy at an earlier time...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.16,0:15:38.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,maybe my father would have survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.66,0:15:40.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When I think about that, I can't let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.36,0:15:46.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I didn't have the slightest interest\Nin this sort of thing before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.56,0:15:50.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, if I'm to help those who suffer\Nfrom the same affliction that my father did,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.46,0:15:52.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will need to use my profession.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.46,0:15:57.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I understand how you feel. Many others in\Nthe past have reached the same conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.66,0:16:00.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, they all failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.66,0:16:02.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.76,0:16:07.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The micromachine lobby is too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:09.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It controls too many people in too many places.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.96,0:16:11.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So it is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.46,0:16:16.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Fortunately, however, I know a lot of\Npeople in the entertainment industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:22.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,From what I hear, there are several in the\Nindustry who are secretly receiving the Murai vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.20,0:16:27.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It is difficult to spread\Nstories of a serious nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.00,0:16:30.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In order to spread the story, isn't a...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.60,0:16:33.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,scandal necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.00,0:16:39.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems that your visit here was well planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.10,0:16:48.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To tell you the truth,\Nwe have obtained a certain file.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:49.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A file?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.61,0:16:56.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Confirmed contact with the bar association.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.31,0:16:58.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's crude encryption.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.81,0:17:03.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder if those amateurs are\Nunderestimating us... the fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.71,0:17:05.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Two minutes until arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.83,0:17:10.74,Style,,0,0,900,,{\i1\b1}List of Murai Vaccine Recipients{\i\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:15.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, please take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:20.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, is this the famous author...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:24.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes. There are also artist, former athletes...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.32,0:17:26.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This one is a professor at Hamada Medical School.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.12,0:17:30.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm amazed... There are even names of politicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.22,0:17:35.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes... an even more significant figure\Nhas been treated with the vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.86,0:17:37.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Can you pick him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.66,0:17:43.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Imakurusu Hisashi... the Chairman of\Nthe Central Drug Evaluation Committee!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.76,0:17:49.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Chairman, who did not approve the\NMurai vaccine, is himself dependent on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.66,0:17:53.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This file was sent to us\Nyesterday by Imakurusu himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:55.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What does this all mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:18:01.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Imakurusu said that he had grown tired of\Nkeeping his silence after all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.26,0:18:08.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He had accepted its efficacy, yet had to\Ndeliberately suppress it due to superior influences.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.66,0:18:16.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He promised that he would testify in court\Nabout the reasons that only he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.36,0:18:18.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The central figure of the\Ndrug evaluation committee
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.96,0:18:22.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,said that he would testify regarding the\Ndeliberate suppression of the vaccine?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.16,0:18:22.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.06,0:18:25.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This time, we will win!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:02.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Narcotics Department's assault team!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.75,0:19:06.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Come on, guys. Kill them already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.45,0:19:08.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We can look for the target at our leisure later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.75,0:19:10.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,First, kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.65,0:19:13.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The attackers are affiliated with the\NMinistry of Health, Labour and Welfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.35,0:19:15.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then, this file is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.95,0:19:17.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You have to run, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.55,0:19:20.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,These troops are professionals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.25,0:19:21.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.05,0:19:23.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm with Public Safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.36,0:19:32.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This way is still safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.26,0:19:34.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm entrusting you with this file!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.36,0:19:36.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Make sure what happened\Nhere gets out to the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.06,0:19:40.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Someone needs to tell the\Ntruth that is in this file!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.76,0:19:43.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, that's your responsibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:45.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You have a better chance to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:49.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, how's that room going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.06,0:19:51.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In any case, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.14,0:20:03.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oops, our men are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.02,0:20:17.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, we need to take some hits, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.02,0:20:20.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's what I call reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.72,0:20:21.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.46,0:20:45.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Find the corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.11,0:20:54.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A cyborg!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.37,0:21:13.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Mmm, this is getting interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.77,0:21:15.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There is a survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.37,0:21:16.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Get the hell over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.61,0:21:25.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, hey. If you don't run\Nquickly, I'll shoot you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.84,0:21:30.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.24,0:21:32.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Isn't that our truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.84,0:21:35.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Go finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.89,0:21:48.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief, our mission is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.39,0:21:50.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, the file is a copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.89,0:21:52.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.49,0:21:54.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We know the origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:57.23,Default - Copy,,0,600,700,,HISASHI IMAKURUSU
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:57.23,Default - Copy,,500,0,700,,SUNFLOWER SOCIETY
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:57.23,Default - Copy,,0,250,500,,DOCUMENTS (COPY)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.29,0:21:56.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was Imakurusu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.59,0:22:00.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you the one who has the original?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.59,0:22:02.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No! It wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.79,0:22:03.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.79,0:22:09.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The copy that the Sunflower\NSociety had was sent from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.69,0:22:12.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I hope you haven't allowed guilt to overcome\Nyou, after all these years...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.79,0:22:14.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What would be the benefit of doing such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.09,0:22:18.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Someone is just using my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.29,0:22:21.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What about the fact that your name is on\Nthe list of those who received the vaccine?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.09,0:22:24.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.29,0:22:26.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you have cyberbrain sclerosis?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.71,0:22:29.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes... from a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.41,0:22:32.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It is already in its terminal phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.21,0:22:36.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why didn't you come to me for advice?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.41,0:22:39.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You made huge mistake leaving\Nyour name on the list!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.11,0:22:41.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I apologise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.91,0:22:44.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, as we thought, the Murai vaccine works.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.61,0:22:46.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We knew that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.01,0:22:48.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You will be dealt with!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.61,0:22:51.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What shall we do? Eliminate him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.01,0:22:54.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Shut up. I'll contact you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.45,0:22:59.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Terminal phase, did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.98,0:23:02.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The fool...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.08,0:23:05.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.78,0:23:09.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Maybe I should've become a cyborg, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.74,0:23:17.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.24,0:23:18.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.84,0:23:20.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've been hit...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.94,0:23:25.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm so tired...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.43,0:23:34.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.79,0:24:13.48,Default,,0,0,900,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.69,0:24:17.19,Default,,0,0,900,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.68,0:24:21.71,Default,,0,0,900,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.00,0:24:24.98,Default,,0,0,900,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.98,0:24:29.32,Default,,0,0,900,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.44,0:24:33.81,Default,,0,0,900,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.87,0:24:36.97,Default,,0,0,900,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.74,0:24:41.74,Default,,0,0,900,,But wake a lithium flower, just about to bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.89,0:24:44.59,Default,,0,0,900,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.58,0:24:49.36,Default,,0,0,900,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.98,0:24:54.18,Default,,0,0,900,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.18,0:24:54.68,Default,,0,0,900,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.88,0:24:57.48,Default,,0,0,900,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.28,0:24:59.48,Default,,0,0,900,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.85,0:25:01.75,Default,,0,0,900,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.85,0:25:04.85,Default,,0,0,900,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.36,0:25:08.66,Default,,0,0,900,,When she wakes up
